; Program 2 (Part III)
;
; The Part III simulator provides built-in TRAP services used by this program:
;   TRAP 4 -> read 24 word tokens from the card-reader file into memory and print 6 sentences
;   TRAP 5 -> read one uppercase query word from keyboard into memory
;   TRAP 6 -> search stored words and print: WORD SENTENCE# WORD#

        LOC     32
        TRAP    4
        TRAP    5
        TRAP    6
        HLT
